d into fourth-generation emulsions like Lipoplus, associated with anti-inflammatory effects.\",1\r\n\n\n-----Relationships-----\nhuman_readable_id,source,target,description,combined_degree\r\n4691,NUTRICIÓN PARENTERAL,SMOFLIPID,\"NUTRICIÓN PARENTERAL refers to the method of providing nutrition intravenously to patients who are unable to consume food orally or through the gastrointestinal tract. SMOFLIPID is a specific lipid emulsion utilized within this context. It is designed to offer a balanced source of lipids, which includes essential omega-3 fatty acids, thereby enhancing the nutritional support provided through parenteral nutrition. SMOFLIPID plays a crucial role in ensuring that patients receive the necessary fats for their health and recovery when traditional feeding methods are not viable.\",451\r\n4690,NUTRICIÓN PARENTERAL,LIPOFUNDINA,\"NUTRICIÓN PARENTERAL refers to a method of providing nutrition to individuals who cannot obtain adequate nutrition through oral intake. Within this context, LIPOFUNDINA is a lipid emulsion specifically utilized in parenteral nutrition. It serves as a vital component by supplying a source of energy and essential fatty acids, which are crucial for maintaining the nutritional needs of patients receiving parenteral nutrition.\",449\r\n4700,NUTRICIÓN PARENTERAL,RECIÉN NACIDOS PREMATUROS,Preterm infants are the primary beneficiaries of parenteral nutrition to prevent undernutrition,449\r\n4928,NUTRICIÓN PARENTERAL,LIPOPLUS,Lipoplus is used in parenteral nutrition to deliver essential fatty acids and support metabolic needs,447\r\n4745,NUTRICIÓN PARENTERAL,INSUFICIENCIA HEPÁTICA,Insuficiencia hepática necessitates careful management of lipid intake in parenteral nutrition,445\r\n4859,NUTRICIÓN PARENTERAL,COLESTASIS,\"Cholestasis is often associated with parenteral nutrition, typically occurring after steatosis\",442\r\n4922,NUTRICIÓN PARENTERAL,OMEGAVEN,\"Omegaven is used in parenteral nutrition to treat liver disease in patients,